_v6/sfx_spiderverse_90s.wav` (`48 kHz` 16-bit stereo, `90.0417 s`) + `renders_v6/audio_v6_sv_mix_90s.m4a` (AAC 256k, `TP <= -1.0 dBFS`):\n   - Layer **Across the Spider-Verse stylized sonic accents** onto the F1 V6 telemetry engine + *After Hours* 108 BPM mix:\n     * **Act I (`f=1..788`, Earth-1610 Miles)**: crisp comic mid-punch + snappy vinyl-transient upshift whip cracks;\n     * **Portal Cut 1->2 (`f=788..791`) & Cut 2->3 (`f=1601..1604`)**: unmistakable **Spider-Verse Dimensional Glitch** (bitcrushed pitch-tear + reverse-riser + tape-stop snap);\n     * **Act II (`f=789..1601`, Earth-65 Gwen)**: lush wide stereo shimmer/chorus air tail on high-RPM exhaust & pass-bys;\n     * **Act III (`f=1602..2161`, Earth-928 2099)**: aggressive Spider-2099 / Prowler-inspired distorted brass-synth bass edge under acceleration + **huge cinematic Sub-Bass Drop + 2-frame rhythmic stutter/impact hit at `f=1698..1699`** (`t_vid = 70.708 s`, Stowe heavy-braking Impact Frame!) and `f=312..313` (`t_vid = 12.958 s`, Village hairpin)!\n2) Build `pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh` supporting BOTH `--clips` mode (muxing the 3× 4-second showcase clips + stitching `v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4`) AND `--full` mode (for full 2161-frame `renders_v6/frames/f_%04d.jpg` -> `renders_v6/f1_silverstone_spiderverse_1080p.mp4` when rendered).\n   - Exact clip frame windows & audio start offsets (`t_vid = (f_start - 1) / 24.0`, `96` frames = `4.000 s` each @ 24 fps):\n     * `clip1_miles_1610.mp4`: `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip1_miles_1610/f_%04d.jpg` (`-start_number 61`, `f=61..156`, audio `ss=2.500`, `t=4.000`)\n     * `clip2_gwen_65.mp4`: `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip2_gwen_65/f_%04d.jpg` (`-start_number 1290`, `f=1290..1385`, audio `ss=53.708333`, `t=4.000`)\n     * `clip3_2099_impact.mp4`: `renders_v6/clips_frames/clip3_2099_impact/f_%04d.jpg` (`-start_number 1650`, `f=1650..1745`, audio `ss=68.708333`, `t=4.000`)\n     * `v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4`: concatenates Clip 1 + Clip 2 + Clip 3 with tiny 2-frame dimensional glitch audio/fade micro-joins (`12.0 s`, zero clicks, `TP <= -1.0 dBFS`).\n3) Generate & verify the 90.04s WAV + M4A now, then wait (`swarm_wait`) for `@anim` to finish rendering `renders_v6/clips_frames/`. As soon as `@anim` hands off, run `bash pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh --clips`, verify all MP4s with `ffprobe`/`volumedetect`, and post handoff naming `@verifier` (`@verifier`: verify 100% V5 isolation, `v6_stage_anim_sv.blend` NPR nodes/outlines/CMYK/Kuwahara/On-Twos, 26 stills + `comic_page_sheet.jpg`, all 4 MP4s, and `docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md`, then tag `@coordinator`!)."}}]}
