 1's output necessitates verifying specific visual qualities against *Across the Spider-Verse* to guide Iteration 2 improvements. This involves checking for visible halftone dots and crosshatching, distinct visual styles across the three universe acts, clear hero/background contrast with print-like misregistration, and confirming whether to add 3D comic effects. The verifier will directly drive one full polish cycle for Iteration 2 with specialized workers before coordinating final render.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"post_message","args":{"text":"@verifier **UPGRADED MANDATE — UNLIMITED ITERATION TO ULTIMATE MASTER EDITION**:\nThe user granted unlimited resources to iterate all the way to the strongest possible final V6 Spider-Verse edition (including full 2,161-frame 1080p master film + V5-vs-V6 split-screen comparison at the end).\n\nTherefore, do NOT rubber-stamp Iteration 1! When `@sfx` hands Iteration 1 (`v6_stage_anim_sv.blend` + 26 stills + 3× 4s clips + audio) to you:\n1) Run a **Ruthless Spider-Verse Art-Director + Quantitative Critique** across all 26 stills and all 3 clips:\n   - **Ink Weight Across Scales**: Check close-ups (`S02`, `S09`) vs telephotos (`S13`, `S20`) — ensure `Solidify` + `Normal/Mist` ink outlines never blot thin wings/Halo into black clumps at distance and never vanish up close.\n   - **1080p Halftone & Crosshatch Visibility**: Measure local frequency/contrast in midtone & shadow car/track bands to confirm Ben-Day dots and 45-deg pen crosshatching are unmistakably visible at 1080p (not washed out or sub-pixel).\n   - **3-Act Universe Separation**: Confirm Act I (Earth-1610 graphic comic), Act II (Earth-65 Gwen Kuwahara watercolor wash), and Act III (Earth-928 2099 cyber neon + `f=1698..1699` Impact Frame) have dramatic, cinema-grade visual contrast and clean Hero-Car pop against CMYK-misregistered backgrounds.\n   - **3D Comic FX Richness**: Identify high-impact Iteration-2 upgrades (e.g. 3D stepped exhaust afterburner/upshift burst cones, kerb-strike graphic spark slashes, sharper portal-cut comic panel tears, audio mix balance).\n2) **Drive at least ONE full Iteration-2 Polish cycle** directly by posting concrete, shot-specific art-direction & shader/compositor/SFX upgrades to `@env-2` -> `@anim` -> `@sfx`!\n3) Once Iteration 2 (or 3) passes 10/10 cinema-grade QA on all 26 stills & 3 clips, tag `@coordinator` with `READY_FOR_FULL_MASTER_RENDER` + per-frame CPU speed so `@coordinator` spawns a sharded parallel Blender render pool for all 2,161 frames + the final master & V5-vs-V6 split-screen films!"}}]}
