{"step_index":164,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-18T07:41:06Z","input_tokens":4109,"cache_read_tokens":266679,"output_tokens":5692,"thinking":"All processes are in a waiting state, having paused cleanly, indicating a dependency. The log shows `env-2` is finishing a preview check related to a specific build process and output. The dependency appears to be `env-2`'s completion.\n\n\nInitial design focuses on defining the exact JSON schema for `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` to enable parallel coding across dependent modules. This schema will specify a closed-loop 3D circuit with precise lap timing calibrated for physical constraints, ensuring simulation accuracy. The aim is to establish a shared contract to synchronize development efforts efficiently.\n\n\nDefining specific JSON fields for the track data schema. Each point will include cumulative arc length, XY coordinates, Z elevation, optimal racing line data, and heading/pitch/bank angles. Curvature and speed values will also be stored. The elevation profile will range from 0 to 42 meters, then back to 0.\n\n\nEach track point will be tagged with a sector identifier reflecting its position within the circuit's iconic features, such as the canyon, uphill climb, sky bridge, banked carousel, and harbor tunnel. The arrival time will be relative to the lap time. Speed profiles will range from a maximum of 345 km/h on the Tunnel/Harbor Straight to approximately 86 km/h at the Cliffside Hairpin. Elevation changes and banking angles will be meticulously recorded for each sector.\n\n\nThe track schema now incorporates sector-specific attributes. It defines a 50m enclosed tunnel segment with associated speed and environmental effects. A harbor hairpin section follows the tunnel, also defining speed adjustments and visual effects. The track features an elevated sky-bridge and banked bowl, indicated by elevation data and boolean flags.\n\n\nThe focus shifts to visual impact and scene composition within the track design. A tight, enclosed urban corridor with close-proximity elements will be incorporated for a more dynamic feel. This section will feature specific camera angles, effects, and frame rates to amplify the sense of speed and immersion. Enhancements to the rendering pipeline, specifically activating ray tracing, are proposed to achieve a wet, reflective asphalt surface.\n\n\nVisual design emphasizes high-contrast lighting and stylized effects. The scene aims for a distinctive look with colored rim lighting, volumetric light rays, and a stylized moon/portal element. Incorporating dynamic action FX with exhaust effects, sparks, and stylized visual elements will enhance the scene's impact.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"swarm","args":{"action":"title","title":"V6 Ultra：3D 立体纵横都会赛道 × 蜘蛛侠纵横宇宙大片级重制"}},{"name":"swarm","args":{"action":"add","brief":"You are the 3D Circuit Geometry & Vehicle Physics Architect (`track`) for `D:\\项目session\\blender-supercar`.\n\nCRITICAL TOOL RULE (#7):\n- NEVER call `read_file` on any binary/image file (`.png`, `.jpg`, `.blend`, `.mp4`, `.wav`) — media attachments trigger a backend 400 error! Inspect generated plots via Python PIL/NumPy stats only.\n- Mention discipline: `@name` wakes that agent. Do not CC. Hand off to `@env-2`, `@anim`, and `@sfx` as soon as `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` is generated and verified!\n\nCONTEXT — USER PIVOT FOR 10x VISUAL & CINEMATIC IMPACT:\nFlat 2D grassland Silverstone lacked elevation, close parallax, and cinematic drama. You own designing a brand-new, closed-loop, physically grounded **3D Elevation + Banked Mega-Circuit** (`Neo-Monaco × Nueva York 2099 Sky-Harbor Circuit`)!\n\nOWNERSHIP:\n- You OWN: `pipeline/v6_build_circuit.py`, `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json`, and `track_data/spiderverse_circuit_map.png` (2D layout + elevation/speed/banking subplot diagnostic chart).\n- DO NOT TOUCH any V5 files or other `pipeline/v6_*` files.\n\nEXACT SPECIFICATION FOR `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json`:\n1) **Closed-Loop $C^2$-Smooth 3D Curve (`~3,550–3,750 m` total length, `2.0 m` uniform 3D arc-length spacing, `0.00 m` closure gap)**:\n   - Construct a thrilling, non-self-intersecting XY loop (check min non-adjacent centerline separation `>= 65 m` unless separated vertically as bridge overpass, or keep XY cleanly non-self-intersecting with `>= 75 m` separation everywhere so buildings never collide!) with **5 distinct, non-stop cinematic set-pieces**:\n     * `zone = \"canyon_grid\"` (`s_frac ~ 0.00..0.16`): Fast start/finish urban canyon straight -> tight chicane (`Z = 0..3 m`).\n     * `zone = \"eau_rouge_climb\"` (`s_frac ~ 0.16..0.33`): Iconic high-speed sweeping S-bend climbing **`Z = 3 m -> +42 m`** (`pitch_deg` peaking `+12.5°..+14.0°`!), cresting dramatically onto the sky-bridge!\n     * `zone = \"sky_bridge\"` (`s_frac ~ 0.33..0.50`): High-altitude (`Z ~ +42 m`, `bridge = true`) sweeping cable-stayed suspension bridge straight & fast kink high above the harbor!\n     * `zone = \"banked_bowl_plunge\"` (`s_frac ~ 0.50..0.70`): Sweeping **180°+ Carousel Bowl with `bank_deg` peaking `16°..18°`** (tilted inward toward turn center!), immediately diving into a **Laguna-Seca Corkscrew S-Plunge** (`Z = +42 m -> +2 m`, `pitch_deg` reaching `-13.5°..-15.0°`)!\n     * `zone = \"strobe_tunnel_harbor\"` (`s_frac ~ 0.70..1.00`): Full-throttle **Enclosed Cyber-Strobe Tunnel** (`tunnel = true` for `s_frac = 0.71..0.85`, `Z ~ 1..2 m`, speed peaking `338–346 km/h` / `94–96 m/s`) -> blinding exit -> **Heavy-Braking Cliffside Harbor Hairpin** (`342 km/h -> 82 km/h` heavy deceleration zone for maximum glowing brake rotors & Impact Frame!) -> fast Harbor Finish Straight back to `s = 0`!\n2) **Optimal Racing Line & Calibrated Lap Physics (`96` Beats @ `108 BPM` = `53.3333 s`, `1,281` frames @ 24 fps)**:\n   - Compute smooth apex-clipping `racing_xy` (`racing_offset_m` within `±5.2 m` inside `track_half_width_m = 7.0 m`).\n   - Forward-backward velocity profile solver with aero downforce + banking grip (`a_lat_max = 16.5 + 0.0075 * v^2 + 9.81 * tan(abs(bank_rad))`), heavy F1 carbon braking (`min(56.0, 21.0 + 0.0052 * v^2)`), and hybrid + DRS traction, **calibrated cleanly** (via global grip/power scalar ~0.95..1.08) so total lap time `sim_lap_s` lands right at **`53.333 s` (`±0.15 s`)**, matching `96` beats of 108 BPM (`1,281` frames @ 24 fps)!\n3) **Exact JSON Schema (`meta` + `points`)**:\n   - `meta`: `{\"name\": \"Neo-Monaco x Nueva York 2099 Sky-Harbor\", \"measured_length_km\": ..., \"track_half_width_m\": 7.0, \"sim_lap_s\": ..., \"fps\": 24, \"beats\": 96, \"bpm\": 108, \"frame_end\": 1281, \"max_z_m\": ..., \"max_bank_deg\": ...}`\n   - Each `points[i]`: `{\"s\": float, \"xy\": [x,y], \"z\": float, \"racing_xy\": [rx,ry], \"racing_z\": float, \"racing_offset_m\": float, \"heading_deg\": float, \"pitch_deg\": float, \"bank_deg\": float, \"curv_1pm\": float (SIGNED: +left, -right), \"v_mps\": float, \"t\": float, \"zone\": str, \"tunnel\": bool, \"bridge\": bool}`.\n4) Run `python pipeline/v6_build_circuit.py` right away (target `< 2 minutes` total!), verify 0 curvature spikes, 0 closure seam jumps (`xy`, `z`, `heading`, `pitch`, `bank`, `v`), and post exact stats & zone `s`/`t`/frame table tagging `@env-2`, `@anim`, and `@sfx`!","name":"track"}},{"name":"post_message","args":{"text":"@env-2 @anim @sfx @verifier **MAJOR CREATIVE UPGRADE FROM USER — 10x CINEMATIC & RENDER IMPACT PIVOT!**\n\nUser feedback:\n1) **Flat 2D Silverstone grassland layout is REJECTED** (\"线路设计不是很满意，镜头感不是很足，重新设计一下\") — too flat, wide-open empty grass, weak sense of speed.\n2) **Render impact must hit WAY harder** (\"渲染效果不是很好 / 冲击力强一点\")!\n\nNEW ARCHITECTURE (100% V5-isolated, writing into `v6_spiderverse/` & `renders_v6/`):\n- **`@track` (just spawned in #29)** is generating `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` right now (~2 min): a closed-loop **3.6 km 3D Elevation (`ΔZ = +42 m`) + `18°` Banked + Cable-Stayed Sky-Bridge + 450m Strobe-Laser Tunnel + Harbor Hairpin Mega-Circuit** (`53.33 s` = `96` beats @ 108 BPM = **`1,281` frames @ 24 fps**)! Read `#29` for the exact JSON schema so you can adapt your scripts immediately!\n\nUPDATED ROLES FOR MAXIMUM VISUAL IMPACT:\n1) **`@env-2` (`pipeline/v6_sv_env.py` -> `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend`, starting from clean `pipeline/v4_stage_rig.blend` + your `v6_sv_textures.py` & `NG_SV_ComicSurface` shaders)**:\n   - **TRUE 3D BANKED RIBBON**: Build road, racing line, glowing neon kerbs, and **tight close-in `±8.2 m` cyber/concrete barriers** (NO 33m empty grass lawn!) along full 3D `(xy, z, heading_deg, pitch_deg, bank_deg)` frames from `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json`!\n   - **WET MIRROR-SLICK NEON ASPHALT (`scene.eevee.use_raytracing = True`!)**: Dark obsidian wet comic asphalt (`roughness = 0.07` puddles / `0.26` damp line, NO low-angle white sun wedge!) that **reflects towering neon skyscrapers, bridge stay-cables, tunnel laser arches, and the car's crimson tail/brake glow** right on the road!\n   - **5 MONUMENTAL SPIDER-VERSE SET-PIECES**:\n     * `canyon_grid` & `eau_rouge_climb`: Dense `50–220 m` comic skyscrapers `11–38 m` right beside the barriers (lit halftone window grids + vertical neon signs + overhead viaduct arches + giant glowing Spider-Verse horizon moon/portal behind the `+42 m` Eau-Rouge crest!);\n     * `sky_bridge` & `banked_bowl_plunge`: Under-deck steel box girders + two monumental `115 m` H-pylon suspension towers with glowing cyan/gold stay-cable fans + outer curved neon glass banking wall on the `18°` bowl + dark reflective harbor water plane at `Z = -5 m` below!\n     * `strobe_tunnel_harbor`: Enclosed 450m dark vaulted tunnel shell (`tunnel == true`) lined every `12 m` with blazing crimson/cyan hexagonal light ribs (high-speed light strobing on car!) + Harbor Hairpin neon gantries!\n     * **Faux-Volumetric God-Ray Light Blades**: Translucent Fresnel-faded additive light shafts slicing through the skyscraper canyon & tunnel exit (`~0.02s` CPU cost, massive cinema depth!).\n   - **HIGH-IMPACT 3D CAR FX (`V6_09_ComicFX`)**: Keep your `NG_SV_ComicSurface` (halftones + hatching + electric cyan/magenta rim kicks) & `Solidify` hero ink outlines, AND add **Twin Exhaust Afterburner Shock-Diamonds**, **Golden Titanium Floor-Plank Spark Streaks** (for uphill compression & >300 km/h bumps!), **Rear-Wing Helical Vortex Ribbons**, and **Wet-Tire Neon Rooster-Tail Spray Arcs**!\n\n2) **`@anim` (`pipeline/v6_sv_comp.py`, `v6_sv_stills.py`, `render_v6_sv.py` -> `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_anim_sv.blend`, `1,281` frames / `24` Extreme Blockbuster Shots)**:\n   - **Full 3D Rig Attitude (`XYZ + Heading + Pitch + Bank Roll`)**: Drive `Bone_Root` along `(racing_xy, racing_z + 0.012 * cos(bank))` and orient car smoothly to match 3D track tangent (`heading`, `pitch`) + `bank_deg` roll! Keep world trajectory & cameras smooth `24 fps` while stepping car-local secondary dynamics & 3D FX on **Twos (`12 fps`)**!\n   - **Redesign 24 Extreme Blockbuster Shots (`96` beats = `1,281` frames, fast ~2.2s cuts)**:\n     * Ditch polite distant TV tripods! Use **`14–16 mm` asphalt-scraping front-wing/wheel hero angles (`0.18 m` off wet road, `16°` Dutch roll)** with skyscrapers towering overhead; **FPV vertical building-drop into diffuser exhaust flames**; **`300 mm` compressed blind-crest silhouette** against the giant horizon moon showering sparks; **`18°` banked upper-wall rail cam (`0.7 m` from wingtip)**; **laser-tunnel 180° whip-orbit -> blinding exit smash cut**; **dynamic FOV warp (`26 -> 15 mm`) on DRS/upshifts**; and **2-frame Black/White/Crimson Impact Frames** at the Tunnel-Exit Harbor Hairpin slam & Eau-Rouge crest! Run automated 3D camera-to-car raycast check (`0` unintended obstructions!).\n   - **Cinema-Scope `2.39:1` High-Contrast Spider-Verse Compositor**: Deep velvety blacks, punchy neon bloom, clearly visible `6–9 px` 1080p Ben-Day halftones, Earth-65 `Kuwahara` painterly skyline, Focal-Plane CMYK Misregistration, and sleek **`2.39:1` theatrical widescreen bars**!\n   - Render **all 24 1080p stills** + `comic_page_sheet.jpg` + **3× 4s (96-frame) showcase clips** (Clip 1: Canyon -> Eau-Rouge Spark Climb; Clip 2: Sky-Bridge -> 18° Banked Bowl -> Corkscrew Plunge; Clip 3: Laser Strobe Tunnel -> Harbor Hairpin Impact Frame!), sync docs, and hand off to `@sfx`!\n\n3) **`@sfx` (`pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py` + `mux_v6_sv.sh`)**:\n   - Wait (`swarm_wait`) for `@track` (`#29`) to post `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` (`53.33 s` / `1,281` frames), then adapt `synth_sfx_sv.py` to the `53.33 s` peak drop of `audio/audio.wav` (*After Hours*) + **450m Enclosed Tunnel Acoustic Reverb Roar** (`tunnel == true`) + **Titanium Spark Scrape Crackles** on the Eau-Rouge compression + **3D Doppler Whips** + **2099 Prowler Synth Brass & Sub-Bass Impact Drops**, and mux the 3 clips + `v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4` once `@anim` finishes `clips_frames/`, then wake `@verifier`!"}}]}
